# 0178 P2b: EINT child controller + dedicated workloop oneshot (docs/68).
# SPI288 parent -> RubyEINT line controller -> child event source ->
# dedicated workloop action (SPI3 read + HID) -> service_done.  The old
# gt_thread is removed; gt commands/diag go through the IOCommandGate on
# the same workloop.  Native parent default stays; cmdline is unchanged.
